    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Betrayal by a Friend"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "For the choir director: with stringed instruments. A Maskil of David."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "God, listen to my prayer",
          "and do not hide from my plea for help."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Pay attention to me and answer me.",
          "I am restless and in turmoil with my complaint,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "because of the enemy’s words,",
          "because of the pressure of the wicked.",
          "For they bring down disaster on me",
          "and harass me in anger."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "My heart shudders within me;",
          "terrors of death sweep over me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Fear and trembling grip me;",
          "horror has overwhelmed me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I said, “If only I had wings like a dove!",
          "I would fly away and find rest."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "How far away I would flee;",
          "I would stay in the wilderness."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I would hurry to my shelter",
          "from the raging wind and the storm.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Lord, confuse and confound their speech, ,",
          "for I see violence and strife in the city;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "day and night they make the rounds on its walls.",
          "Crime and trouble are within it;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "destruction is inside it;",
          "oppression and deceit never leave its marketplace."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Now it is not an enemy who insults me —",
          "otherwise I could bear it;",
          "it is not a foe who rises up against me —",
          "otherwise I could hide from him."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "But it is you, a man who is my peer,",
          "my companion and good friend!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "We used to have close fellowship;",
          "we walked with the crowd into the house of God."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Let death take them by surprise;",
          "let them go down to Sheol alive,",
          "because evil is in their homes and within them."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "But I call to God,",
          "and the Lord will save me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I complain and groan morning, noon, and night,",
          "and he hears my voice."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          18
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Though many are against me,",
          "he will redeem me from my battle unharmed."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "God, the one enthroned from long ago,",
          "will hear and will humiliate them"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "because they do not change",
          "and do not fear God."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          20
        ],
        "lines": [
          "My friend acts violently",
          "against those at peace with him;",
          "he violates his covenant."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          21
        ],
        "lines": [
          "His buttery words are smooth,",
          "but war is in his heart.",
          "His words are softer than oil,",
          "but they are drawn swords."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          22
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Cast your burden on the Lord,",
          "and he will sustain you;",
          "he will never allow the righteous to be shaken."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          23
        ],
        "lines": [
          "God, you will bring them down",
          "to the Pit of destruction;",
          "men of bloodshed and treachery",
          "will not live out half their days.",
          "But I will trust in you."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
